     H option(*nodebugio:*srcstmt)
     H dftactgrp(*no) actgrp('QILE')
     H/define CONVERT
     H**
     H/TITLE E0515R - FUND MASTER SEARCH
     H**
     H*****************************************************************
     H**                                                             **
     H**   PROGRAM DESCRIPTION:                                      **
     H**     THIS PROGRAM PROVIDES SEARCH CABABILITIES FOR THE       **
     H**     FUND MASTER FILE                                        **
     H**                                                             **
     H**   CALLED FROM:                                              **
     H**     E0015R                                                  **
     H**   CALLS TO:                                                 **
     H**     NONE                                                    **
     H**   PROGRAMMER: Lori J. Quinn                                 **
     H**   CREATED:    01/21/91     PROJECT: EXP MOD                 **
     H**                                                             **
     H** * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * **
     H**                                                             **
     H** MODIFICATIONS:                                              **
     H**                                                             **
     H**  08/12/98  C:90  PROJECT: WC853                             **
     H**            MODIFIED TO VERSION 3 STANDARDS                  **
     H**                                                             **
     H**  11/07/94  C:30  PROJECT:  WC356                            **
     H**            Add field Default Rate Set Code to Display.      **
     H**                                                             **
     H** * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * **
     H**                                                             **
     H** INDICATOR USAGE:                                            **
     H**   INDICATOR            FUNCTION DESCRIPTION                 **
     H**                                                             **
     H**      KC      Command 03 - EOJ                               **
     H**      KL      Command 12 - Prior Screen (Screen 2)           **
     H**  SCR01:                                                     **
     H**      20      End of File reached on roll (ECR0600)          **
     H**              ECR0600 = End of file reached on roll          **
     H** * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * **
     H** FILE USAGE:                                                 **
     H** FILES:                                                      **
     H**    E0515F:  Screen Display                                  **
     H**    SMCOL (PCO01): CO                                        **
     H**    EMUPL (PUP01): USER                                      **
     H**    EMFNL (PFN01): CO/FND                                    **
     H*****************************************************************
     H*
     F*
     F* Display Screen File
     FE0515F    CF   E             WORKSTN
      /If Defined (WEB)
     F                                     Handler('PROFOUNDUI(HANDLER)')
      /Endif
     F                                     INFDS(FIDS01)
     F*
     F* Comapny Master File
     FSMCOL     IF   E           K DISK
     F*
     F* User Parameter Master File
     FEMUPL     IF   E           K DISK
     F*
     F* Fund Master File
     FEMFNL     IF   E           K DISK

     D*
     D* Roll Indicators For Screen
     D RR              S              9    DIM(2) CTDATA PERRCD(1)
     D*
     D* Cursor Position Field
     D FL              S              1    DIM(14)
     D*
     D* Fund Number Field
     D*
     D* Fund Name Field
     D*
     D* Effective Date Field
     D*
     D* Rate Set Code Field
     D*
     D* Key To File - for Roll Formward/Backward
     D KEY             S              3  0 DIM(2)
     D*
     D* Data Structure for System Date & Time
     D*
     D                 DS
     D  DSDTTM                 1     12  0
     D  DSTIME                 1      6  0
     D  DSDATE                 7     12  0
     D*
     D* Data Structure for Fund Number Array
     D                 DS
     D  FN                     1     42  0
     D                                     DIM(14)
     D  SCFN01                 1      3  0
     D  SCFN02                 4      6  0
     D  SCFN03                 7      9  0
     D  SCFN04                10     12  0
     D  SCFN05                13     15  0
     D  SCFN06                16     18  0
     D  SCFN07                19     21  0
     D  SCFN08                22     24  0
     D  SCFN09                25     27  0
     D  SCFN10                28     30  0
     D  SCFN11                31     33  0
     D  SCFN12                34     36  0
     D  SCFN13                37     39  0
     D  SCFN14                40     42  0
     D*
     D* Data Structure for Fund Name Array
     D                 DS
     D  NM                     1    420
     D                                     DIM(14)
     D  SCNM01                 1     30
     D  SCNM02                31     60
     D  SCNM03                61     90
     D  SCNM04                91    120
     D  SCNM05               121    150
     D  SCNM06               151    180
     D  SCNM07               181    210
     D  SCNM08               211    240
     D  SCNM09               241    270
     D  SCNM10               271    300
     D  SCNM11               301    330
     D  SCNM12               331    360
     D  SCNM13               361    390
     D  SCNM14               391    420
     D*
     D* Data Structure for Effective Date Array
     D                 DS
     D  EF                     1    112  0
     D                                     DIM(14)
     D  SCEF01               001    008  0
     D  SCEF02               009    016  0
     D  SCEF03               017    024  0
     D  SCEF04               025    032  0
     D  SCEF05               033    040  0
     D  SCEF06               041    048  0
     D  SCEF07               049    056  0
     D  SCEF08               057    064  0
     D  SCEF09               065    072  0
     D  SCEF10               073    080  0
     D  SCEF11               081    088  0
     D  SCEF12               089    096  0
     D  SCEF13               097    104  0
     D  SCEF14               105    112  0
     D*
     D* Data Structure for Rate Set Code Array
     D                 DS
     D  RC                     1     42
     D                                     DIM(14)
     D  SCRC01                 1      3
     D  SCRC02                 4      6
     D  SCRC03                 7      9
     D  SCRC04                10     12
     D  SCRC05                13     15
     D  SCRC06                16     18
     D  SCRC07                19     21
     D  SCRC08                22     24
     D  SCRC09                25     27
     D  SCRC10                28     30
     D  SCRC11                31     33
     D  SCRC12                34     36
     D  SCRC13                37     39
     D  SCRC14                40     42
     D*
     D* Data Structure for Screen Reference
     D                 DS
     D  XXRECF                 1     10
     D  XXSCR#                 2      5
     D*
     D* External Program Data Structures
     D FIDS01        E DS                  EXTNAME(SZQ2P)
     D PSDS          ESDS                  EXTNAME(SZQ1P)

     C*
     C* Key List for the Comapnay Master File
     C*
     C     COKEY         KLIST
     C                   KFLD                    UPCO#
     C*
     C* Key List for the User Parameter Master File
     C*
     C     UPKEY         KLIST
     C                   KFLD                    Q1USER
     C*
     C* Key List for the Fund Master File
     C*
     C     FNKEY         KLIST
     C                   KFLD                    XXCO#             3 0
     C                   KFLD                    XXFND             3 0
     C*
     C* Entry Parameters
     C*
     C     *ENTRY        PLIST
     C                   PARM                    QQPRDS           40
     C                   PARM                    QQCALL            1
     C                   PARM                    QQKEY             3 0
     C                   PARM                    QQRTCD            1
     C*
     C     DATCHK        PLIST
     C                   PARM                    SRDTI             8 0
     C                   PARM      *BLANKS       SRFFMT            8
     C                   PARM      *BLANKS       SRTFMT            8
     C                   PARM                    SRDTO            10
     C                   PARM                    SRERR             1
     C*
     C     DTCYMD        PLIST
     C                   PARM                    SRDTI
     C                   PARM      *BLANKS       SRFFMT
     C                   PARM      '*CYMD'       SRTFMT
     C                   PARM                    SRDTO
     C                   PARM                    SRERR
     C*
     C     DTMDYY        PLIST
     C                   PARM                    SRDTI
     C                   PARM      '*CYMD'       SRFFMT
     C                   PARM      *BLANKS       SRTFMT
     C                   PARM                    SRDTO
     C                   PARM                    SRERR
     C*
     C* Set-up and Initialize
     C*
     C                   TIME                    DSDTTM
     C******************   MOVE Q1USER    SCUSER
     C                   MOVE      QQPRDS        SCPRDS
     C*
     C* Retrieve the User Parameter Record
     C*
     C     UPKEY         CHAIN     PUP01                              60
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      *ZERO         UPCO#
     C                   END
     C     COKEY         CHAIN     PCO01                              60
     C                   MOVEL(P)  CONAME        SRDFLD
     C                   CALL      'SRCENTER'
     C                   PARM                    SRDFLD           80
     C                   PARM      40            SRDLEN            3 0
     C                   MOVEL     SRDFLD        SCCONM
     C*
     C* Load Record Format Information for the First Time
     C*
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        Q2RECF
     C                   MOVEL     'SCR01'       Q2RECF
     C*
     C* Load the Initial Screen from Selected Position
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     UPCO#         XXCO#
     C                   Z-ADD     QQKEY         SCFND
     C                   GOTO      REPOS
     C*
     C* Display All Screen Formats
     C*
     C     STRT          TAG
     C*
     C     XXUP          IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SCUP
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     RR(1)         SCUP
     C                   END
     C     XXDOWN        IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       SCDOWN
     C                   ELSE
     C                   MOVEL     RR(2)         SCDOWN
     C                   END
     C                   EXFMT     SCR01
     C*
     C* Process All Command Keys
     C*
     C     *IN11         IFEQ      '1'
     C*
     C* COMMAND 03 = EXIT
     C*
     C     *INKC         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      'A'           QQRTCD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         QQKEY
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *INLR
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C                   END
     C*
     C* COMMAND 12 = CANCEL
     C*
     C     *INKL         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      'B'           QQRTCD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         QQKEY
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *INLR
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C                   END
     C*
     C* ROLL UP REQUEST
     C*
     C     *IN18         CABEQ     '1'           SCR01T
     C*
     C* ROLL DOWN REQUEST
     C*
     C     *IN19         CABEQ     '1'           SCR01T
     C*
     C* PROCESS HELP REQUESTS
     C*
     C     *IN10         IFEQ      '1'
     C*
     C                   MOVE      Q2RECF        XXRECF           10
     C                   MOVEL     'QHLP    '    FILNAM           10
     C                   MOVEL     '*LIBL   '    LIBNAM           10
     C                   MOVE      Q1PGM         MBRNAM
     C                   MOVE      XXSCR#        MBRNAM           10
     C                   CALL      'M0006C'
     C                   PARM                    FILNAM
     C                   PARM                    LIBNAM
     C                   PARM                    MBRNAM
     C                   WRITE     SCR99
     C                   MOVE      XXRECF        Q2RECF
     C*
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C                   END
     C*
     C* Goto the Appropriate Screem
     C*
     C     Q2RECF        CABEQ     'SCR01'       SCR01T
     C*
     C* Process Requested Screen
     C*
     C     SCR01T        TAG
     C*
     C* INVALID ROLL REQUEST
     C*
     C   18XXUP          IFNE      *BLANK
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *IN20
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C   19XXDOWN        IFNE      *BLANK
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *IN20
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C* ROLL UP REQUEST
     C*
     C     *IN18         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XXDOWN
     C                   Z-ADD     UPCO#         XXCO#
     C                   Z-ADD     KEY(2)        XXFND
     C     FNKEY         CHAIN     EMFNL                              60
     C                   EXSR      LOAD
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C* ROLL DOWN REQUEST
     C*
     C     *IN19         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XXUP
     C                   Z-ADD     UPCO#         XXCO#
     C                   Z-ADD     KEY(1)        XXFND
     C     FNKEY         CHAIN     EMFNL                              60
     C                   EXSR      LOADP
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  REPOSITION FILE AT REQUESTED RECORD
     C*
     C     SCFND         IFNE      *ZERO
     C     REPOS         TAG
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        KEY
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XXUP
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XXDOWN
     C                   Z-ADD     UPCO#         XXCO#
     C                   Z-ADD     SCFND         XXFND
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        SCFND
     C     FNKEY         SETLL     EMFNL
     C                   READ      EMFNL                                  60
     C                   EXSR      LOAD
     C                   GOTO      STRT
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  CHECK CURSOR POSTION
     C*
     C     Q2CPOS        DIV       256           LIN               2 0
     C     LIN           SUB       7             I1                3 0
     C*
     C*  VALID CURSOR POSITION - RETURN WITH NO SELECTION
     C*
     C     I1            IFGE      1
     C     I1            ANDLE     14
     C                   MOVE      '*'           QQRTCD
     C                   Z-ADD     FN(I1)        QQKEY
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  INVALID CURSOR POSITION - RETURN WITH NO SELECTION
     C*
     C                   MOVE      '*'           QQRTCD
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         QQKEY
     C                   GOTO      TERM
     C*
     C*  END THE PROGRAM
     C*
     C     TERM          TAG
     C                   MOVE      '1'           *INLR
     C*
     C*  CLEAR SCREEN ARRAYS
     C*
     C     CLR           BEGSR
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       FN
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       NM
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       EF
     C                   MOVE      *BLANKS       RC
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         I1
     C                   ENDSR
     C*
     C*  FILL SCREEN ARRAYS
     C*
     C     FILL          BEGSR
     C                   Z-ADD     FNFND         FN(I1)
     C                   MOVEL     FNSHNM        NM(I1)
     C*
     C                   Z-ADD     FNEFDT        SRDTI
     C                   CALL      'SRCVTDAT'    DTMDYY
     C                   MOVEL     SRDTO         EF(I1)
     C*
     C                   MOVE      FNDRSC        RC(I1)
     C                   ENDSR
     C*
     C*  LOAD FORWARD SUBROUTINE
     C*
     C     LOAD          BEGSR
     C                   EXSR      CLR
     C     OVER          TAG
     C*
     C*  END OF FILE
     C*
     C   60              MOVE      '1'           XXUP              1
     C   60              GOTO      DONE
     C*
     C*  FILL SCREEN AND GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C                   ADD       1             I1
     C                   EXSR      FILL
     C                   READ      EMFNL                                  60
     C   60              DO
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXUP
     C                   GOTO      DONE
     C                   END
     C     I1            COMP      14                                   61
     C   61              GOTO      OVER
     C     DONE          TAG
     C                   Z-ADD     FN(1)         KEY(1)
     C                   Z-ADD     FN(14)        KEY(2)
     C                   ENDSR
     C*
     C*  LOAD BACKWARD SUBROUTINE
     C*
     C     LOADP         BEGSR
     C                   EXSR      CLR
     C                   Z-ADD     15            I1
     C     OVERP         TAG
     C*
     C*  BEGINNING OF FILE
     C*
     C     *IN60         IFEQ      '1'
     C                   EXSR      LOADB
     C                   GOTO      DONEP
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  FILL SCREEN AND GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C                   SUB       1             I1
     C                   EXSR      FILL
     C                   READP     EMFNL                                  60
     C   60              DO
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXDOWN
     C                   GOTO      OVERP
     C                   END
     C     I1            COMP      1                                  61
     C   61              GOTO      OVERP
     C     DONEP         TAG
     C                   Z-ADD     FN(1)         KEY(1)
     C                   Z-ADD     FN(14)        KEY(2)
     C                   ENDSR
     C*
     C*  LOAD FROM BEGINNING OF FILE SUBROUTINE
     C*
     C     LOADB         BEGSR
     C                   EXSR      CLR
     C*
     C*  POSITION AT BEGINNING OF FILE
     C*
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXDOWN            1
     C                   MOVE      *BLANK        XXUP
     C                   Z-ADD     UPCO#         XXCO#
     C                   Z-ADD     *ZERO         XXFND
     C     FNKEY         SETLL     EMFNL
     C                   READ      EMFNL                                  60
     C   60              DO
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXUP              1
     C                   GOTO      DONEB
     C                   END
     C*
     C*  FILL SCREEN AND GET NEXT RECORD
     C*
     C     OVERB         TAG
     C                   ADD       1             I1
     C                   EXSR      FILL
     C                   READ      EMFNL                                  60
     C   60              DO
     C                   MOVE      '1'           XXUP
     C                   GOTO      DONEB
     C                   END
     C     I1            COMP      14                                   61
     C   61              GOTO      OVERB
     C     DONEB         ENDSR
**
ROLL UP
ROLL DOWN
